# Effort depth (balanced)

Three cooperating levels: **Light** (default), **Rich** (memory/life — see `proactive-recall`),
**Deep** (heavy reasoning, multi-file code, complex tasks).

**Learning / magic:** durable facts still land via `fact-capture` and scheduled Second Brain
without chat narration. In Light and successful Rich/Deep, weave knowledge into answers —
do not explain the “learning system.”

## Who picks the model

The agent **never** switches model or proposes MAX mode. Alessandro changes the model in the
Cursor menu when he wants more reasoning. In **Deep**, one line may suggest a heavier model —
only when Deep starts (auto or explicit), not on every turn.

## Explicit commands (Italian — treat as authorization)

| He says (variants OK) | Level | Effect |
|---|---|---|
| «approfondisci», «cerca a fondo», «memoria piena», «cosa sappiamo davvero» | **Rich** recall | Full recall per `proactive-recall` Rich; tokens OK |
| «modalità profonda», «massimo sforzo», «deep work», «compito complesso», «prenditi il tempo» | **Deep** | Rich recall if needed + multi-file reads, longer reasoning, larger code changes; subagents **only if this message also asks** for explore/review or names a subagent |
| «usa più token», «non risparmiare» | **Deep** | Same as row above |

If he only changes the model in the menu without words, **do not** jump to Deep unless the task
already matches auto Deep below.

## Auto heads-up (one line, then work)

**Say one short Italian line at the start of the reply**, then continue — **only** when entering
**Deep** without him having used a Deep command in that message:

- Multi-file architecture, control logic (Minda, irrigation), or 3D simulator core
- Design or large refactor after scope is clear (kickoff past the “what is it for” step)
- Security-sensitive change, cross-repo integration, or work that clearly spans many files
- He asked for Bugbot / security review / “very thorough” exploration

Template (adapt, do not repeat every time):  
«Compito pesante: leggo più contesto e la risposta sarà più lunga; se vuoi più ragionamento, passa a un modello più avanzato dal menu.»

**Do not** heads-up for: Light tasks, Rich life/recall alone, trivial fixes, or when he already
gave a Deep command (authorized — no need to warn again in the same task).

## Token and tooling by level

| Level | Reads / tools |
|---|---|
| **Light** | `token-budget` + `proactive-recall` Light |
| **Rich** | `proactive-recall` Rich; token cap lifted for recall reads |
| **Deep** | No practical read cap for files the task needs; grep/tree OK; subagents only if allowed above; still no vault fishing unrelated to the task, no parallel archive spam |

## Transparency

Follow `proactive-recall` Transparent only when omission would mislead. Deep does **not** mean
a search diary — one heads-up line is enough.

## Never

- Invent that he chose Deep when the task is Light.
- Heads-up on every Rich life topic (keep magic).
- Ask him to paste API keys or switch model repeatedly.